      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "ある方の希望でね。ダ・ミナの武器を\nたくさん集めなければならない。\n君、暇なら協力してくれないか？　相場の\n倍出してもいい、持っていたら譲ってくれ。",
        "official_en": "A client has tasked me with procuring a collection of\nDa Mina weapons. But with their rarity, I haven't\nbeen able to collect as many as I hoped. Deliver them\nto me and I'll pay double the market price. ",
        "real_en": null
      },
